Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.34,0:00:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Live Me, Love Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.16,0:00:05.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hit Me, Hit Me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.88,0:00:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love Me, Love Me.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.49,0:00:11.20,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H0200E9&\3c&H000000&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.76,0:00:23.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I've never felt enough to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:26.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're still there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.68,0:00:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think we're all right.\NI got a good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:30.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.34,0:00:31.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.25,0:00:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With me, I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.04,0:00:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe this!
Dialogue: 1,0:00:34.48,0:00:38.69,Show_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,650)\c&H2E2C2C&}JUJUTSU KAISEN\N{\fs12\c&HF3F3F3&\bord0\alpha&HFF&\t(237,736,1\alpha&H00&)}The Culling Game Part 1
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.60,0:00:39.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not yet. I don't accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.40,0:00:41.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shit. No mention of my fixtures.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.22,0:00:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not eh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.30,0:00:46.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll give you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.90,0:00:49.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not allowed to. I'm not allowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.16,0:00:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.48,0:00:51.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High tension.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.94,0:01:03.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me! Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.77,0:01:58.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:29.99,0:01:32.99,Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Episode 57\N{\fs30}Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 4
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:01:59.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me! Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.55,0:02:00.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.46,0:02:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love Don't be afraid to be a one-man\NDon't be afraid to be a one-man Don't be
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.37,0:02:02.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,afraid to be a one-man Don't be afraid to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.29,0:02:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,be a one-man Don't run\Naway Let's see you again
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.20,0:02:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kenjaku is going to\Ndrop a bomb on the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.11,0:02:04.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and the Cullen game will\Nfulfill its real purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.02,0:02:05.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of\Nbomb Kenjaku is going to drop,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.94,0:02:06.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's going to happen in the\Nnear future, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.85,0:02:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe even this very moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.76,0:02:08.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I'm preparing by gathering\Nstrong allies and stocking up points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.68,0:02:09.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a few questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is she strong enough\Nbecause I have my doubts?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.10,0:02:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if she's strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.22,0:02:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because I'm just using her as bait\Nto attract other players here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.48,0:02:21.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People tend to be less\Nwary of women, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.98,0:02:25.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So when you're done using her,\Nyou'll just kill her for the points?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.14,0:02:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though you're a bust,\NReggie's my actual true knight.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:38.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as I serve him, he'll\Nprotect me from all danger!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.40,0:02:39.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How naive and stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:45.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,David, do you and your allies possess at\Nleast a hundred points between all of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.98,0:02:46.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Most certainly.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.54,0:02:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A new rule will be added soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.06,0:02:53.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll allow players to transfer\Npoints between each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.58,0:02:55.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hand over your points.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.32,0:02:57.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need them for myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.48,0:03:00.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like negotiations have broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.96,0:03:06.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.92,0:03:10.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.16,0:03:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.16,0:03:15.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.58,0:03:18.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let me see your face again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.76,0:03:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:26.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it, I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.96,0:03:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought you were holding back,\Nbut you can't kill us, can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.98,0:03:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want our points, but\Nonly if we give them to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.10,0:03:37.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think if you fight\Nwithout trying to kill,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.24,0:03:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll regret it the moment\Nyou realize you're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.14,0:04:05.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.52,0:04:07.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:08.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm down here, too, you know!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:08.23,0:04:10.73,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\fs18\1a&H44&}Iori Hazenoki, Current Points: 35
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You dead yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.86,0:04:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You good with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.30,0:04:24.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.10,0:04:40.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it over?
Dialogue: 1,0:04:39.13,0:04:40.93,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\fs18\1a&H44&}Reggie Star, Current Points: 41
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.32,0:04:42.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.56,0:04:43.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.04,0:04:46.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He ran into a room\Nbefore the explosion hit.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.68,0:04:48.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.59,0:04:49.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not bad at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.28,0:04:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet you wore him down a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.56,0:05:02.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you finally get it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.82,0:05:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They have no intention of protecting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.36,0:05:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it a rest already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.58,0:05:23.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:24.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.16,0:05:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reggie said it when I asked him to!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.60,0:05:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he protected me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.54,0:05:32.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he liked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.90,0:05:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you say it!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.24,0:05:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've seen them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.18,0:05:47.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scumbags like you, who care more\Nabout words than real action.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.28,0:05:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a heck of a throw.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now you're all banged up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.36,0:05:56.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't easy climbing\Nback up here, but I made it.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.79,0:05:58.38,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord1\shad0\fs18\1a&H44&\3a&H88&\be2}Chizuru Hari, Current Points: 28
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.76,0:05:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Use the stairs next time, Neanderthal.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.44,0:06:04.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your attention please, your attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.46,0:06:07.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a player has added a new\Nrule to the culling game.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.51,0:06:07.87,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\3a&H00&}9: Players shall be able to view the \Nfollowing information on other players:\Nname, points, number of \Nrules added, current Colony.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.87,0:06:14.02,Onscreen2,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an8\fad(300,0)\3a&H00&}Rule 10: Players are able to\Ntransfer a number of points\Nof their choosing to other Players.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:09.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rule number ten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:12.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Players are able to\Ntransfer a number of points
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.34,0:06:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of their choosing to\Nother players in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.02,0:06:16.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What kind of rule is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.34,0:06:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Max Elephant!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.12,0:06:55.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.42,0:07:11.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.82,0:07:12.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.90,0:07:20.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.56,0:07:24.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll need more points in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.38,0:07:29.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Tsumiki won't be forced to\Nparticipate in the killing anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.42,0:07:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.06,0:07:32.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.42,0:07:34.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't obsess over these guys' points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.24,0:07:37.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is use my full might to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.74,0:07:40.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,brush away any sparks\Nthat might fall on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.48,0:07:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have gained five points for a kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.90,0:07:46.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Man, what a waste of points.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.12,0:07:51.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How pathetic getting killed before\Nhe could even use his technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.60,0:07:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did Remy drop out?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.70,0:07:56.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even so, it's still two on one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.68,0:08:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm still reeling\Nfrom that first explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.74,0:08:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But fleeing's not an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.78,0:08:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should use my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:07.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.94,0:08:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still incomplete.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can close the\Nbarrier and trap them inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.24,0:08:14.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The worst outcome?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.00,0:08:17.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would be them running off\Nand making me waste it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:22.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.40,0:08:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out! Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.42,0:08:38.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two on one. Hmm, I guess in your books\Nthat's what you consider a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.58,0:08:45.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well not in mine where i'm from do you\Nknow what they call people like you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.50,0:08:51.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They call them cowards and\Ncowardly attacks won't work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.80,0:08:54.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Behold!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.82,0:08:57.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zero damage!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:40.18,0:09:42.97,Show_Title,Takaba,0,0,0,,{\fad(1700,0)\3c&HBEDFD4&}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.98,Show_Title,Takaba,0,0,0,,{\fad(1700,0)\3c&H66A8B0&\shad1\be1}JUJUTSU KAISEN
Dialogue: 1,0:09:45.98,0:09:49.36,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\fs18\1a&H44&}Fumihiko Takaba, Current Points: 0
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.82,0:09:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young boy, I can help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.26,0:09:51.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I turned 35 this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.30,0:09:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With one look at someone's face, I can\Ntell if they're a good or bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.88,0:09:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yikes!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.79,0:10:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone ever tell you you\Ngot one bad face? Uh-uh.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.78,0:10:04.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.76,0:10:07.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I use a relative scale, just like schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.68,0:10:09.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Schools use absolute scales.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.64,0:10:10.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.74,0:10:13.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I guess I can trust him for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.78,0:10:15.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, how's Inoki?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.14,0:10:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you make of him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.36,0:10:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know the guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.68,0:10:19.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's quicker.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.59,0:10:20.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll just ask him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.51,0:10:23.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, type, which are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.10,0:10:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.60,0:10:33.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're asking what type of comedian I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.36,0:10:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A type that's always funny, or\Nthe ones deluding themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.24,0:10:39.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you're asking, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.70,0:10:41.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm asking what arrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.24,0:10:45.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This costume is modeled after a hero,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.32,0:10:47.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the person who first made\Nme laugh my guts out?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.58,0:10:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:54.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So to honor this costume, I cannot\Nallow my jokes to fall flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.60,0:10:56.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's a gag I just thought of.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.20,0:11:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try using it on your\Nsweetheart if you have one.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:58.18,0:11:00.89,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\c&H171417&\3c&HFFFFFF&\b1\pos(320,210)}Curse
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.96,0:11:04.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be ready for something.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.52,0:11:06.65,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,425)\fs12\b1\c&H0C0B0C&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(310,296)}Curse
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.84,0:11:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't marry me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want you as my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.08,0:11:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The End
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:55.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.72,0:11:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His curse energy skyrocketed.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.68,0:11:59.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shift in output is massive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.64,0:12:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This guy is strong. Be careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.18,0:12:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm an old-school\Nentertainer who just recently
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.34,0:12:07.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,took a strong like it to extreme violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.04,0:12:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, do you want my help, young boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.06,0:12:20.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once you and I take one of those\Nguys each, the younger guy, look,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.70,0:12:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he can turn his body parts into bombs.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.22,0:12:25.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And he's using reverse curse technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.44,0:12:27.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.84,0:12:29.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kogane! Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.36,0:12:32.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiromi Higuruga's info, now!
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.15,Player_Info,Screen,0,0,0,,{\an5\c&H508E69&\frx0\fry182\frz356\pos(318.667,44)\fs24}Search Results
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.15,Player_Info,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(431.334,111.333)\an5\c&H508E69&\frx0\fry182\frz355}Hiromi Higuruma
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.15,Player_Info,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fry180\an5\pos(334,117.333)\c&H37967E&\frz355}Points
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.15,Player_Info,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fs10\fry180\an5\c&H37967E&\frz355\pos(245.333,131.333)}Rule Added
Dialogue: 1,0:12:32.90,0:12:35.15,Player_Info,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fs14\fry180\an5\frz355\pos(264.667,198)\c&H1A5C41&}Current Colony: Tokyo No. 1
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.34,0:12:35.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Itadori's the one who added that rule.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:35.15,0:12:36.90,Player_Info,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fs30\fry180\an5\c&H7BBAC3&\3c&HA5FFFB&\frz359.2\pos(311.333,172.666)}Points
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.02,0:12:39.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've decided that I'm\Ndone with this colony.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.46,0:12:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back down and I'll let you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.08,0:12:44.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:47.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where do you think you stand in this game?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:48.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still owed points.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.94,0:12:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ones I lost when you\Nkilled Hari before I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.72,0:12:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.63,0:12:53.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Takaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.96,0:12:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try to kill that\Nbomb bastard, if you can?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.44,0:13:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,steal his points before you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.38,0:13:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.24,0:13:06.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.54,0:13:07.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's fight with honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:14.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I am an entertainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.84,0:13:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever I do has got to entertain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.18,0:13:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as you win, I really don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.76,0:13:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:28.87,0:13:30.79,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(316,198)\fs12\b1\c&H0C0B0C&\3c&HFFFFFF&}Curse
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.20,0:13:30.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Smoking!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.90,0:13:39.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What a dangerous technique! Bam! Hurrah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.48,0:13:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.24,0:13:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When it comes to variety shows... Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.14,0:13:49.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Birdie!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.38,0:13:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red is prohibited.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.94,0:14:01.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's funny!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.86,0:14:09.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad you are my enemy, Takaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.02,0:14:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there's a line I\Nalways wanted to hear!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Later, young boy! Try not to die. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.38,0:14:22.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now that guy's dead too after that
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,humiliation Hazenoki's about to\Ncrush your friend I think you should
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.88,0:14:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worry about yourself I warned you\Nlike I said I've achieved my objective
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.34,0:14:36.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in this colony so no more holding\Nback I can fight for real now Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.38,0:15:17.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Max Elephant
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.02,0:15:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, didn't know they came that big?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.52,0:15:36.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.96,0:15:40.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.84,0:15:41.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:08.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:09.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.92,0:16:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh-huh! Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.86,0:16:18.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh-huh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.52,0:16:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah-hoo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.44,0:16:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You figured out my technique, haven't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.90,0:16:58.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a water attack is pretty\Nsimplistic, don't you agree?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.90,0:17:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You manifest whatever's on those receipts,\Nbut there's more to it than that, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.82,0:17:10.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're absolutely correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:15.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to describe, but I'd\Ncall it free-enacting contracts.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.64,0:17:18.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For example, I can do this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.22,0:17:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Contractual recreation.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.78,0:17:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What just burned in my hand\Nwas a receipt for a Third,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.06,0:17:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two-night stay at the five-star
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:34.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,traditional inn Hoshizorate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.38,0:17:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In other words,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.64,0:17:39.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my body is now as refreshed\Nas it would be after a restful
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.16,0:17:42.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and relaxing vacation in a hot\Nsprings resort for three days,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.44,0:17:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,two nights,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.44,0:17:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,plus massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.35,0:17:46.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder how you're faring in comparison.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.68,0:17:51.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No doubt you have injuries from Earlier\Nand you've employed multiple shikigami?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.16,0:17:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why you must be exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.84,0:17:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I often employ multiple shikigami at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.42,0:18:01.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The problem is that one of those was\NMax Elephant which I usually use alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.34,0:18:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can rapidly shuffle through shikigami\Nbut not once they're injured. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:11.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you can't use your\Ndog to run, attack, and defend.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:15.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And because of that you've been forced to
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.68,0:18:18.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,use multiple one trick\Nshikigami all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:23.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a battle of attrition where neither\Nof us can use big, high-output moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.52,0:18:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see? It's futile.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.48,0:18:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.72,0:18:30.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.56,0:18:32.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I'll run.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.58,0:18:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It won't be that easy.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.36,0:18:49.90,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\b1\fs16\pos(292.667,87.333)\shad0\c&H352D2B&\3c&H8F7D89&}Mobile Terrace
Dialogue: 1,0:18:49.94,0:18:51.36,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\fad(175,0)\fnArial\b1\fs10\shad0\c&HFFDFE6&\bord0\pos(318.667,132.666)\frz6.413}Monday, November 12th
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.04,0:18:57.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A community gymnasium.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.04,0:19:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did he flee inside or is he luring me in?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.34,0:19:03.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could smoke him out with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.34,0:19:05.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But getting into another\Nchase would be annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever shall I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.49,0:19:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just as I imagined.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.68,0:19:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect size.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:21.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder what you have planned for\Nme in here, you damned little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.68,0:19:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have something planned\Nyourself, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.70,0:19:33.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All sorcerers tend to\Ntell lies now and then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.52,0:19:46.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hyah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.78,0:19:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.48,0:20:10.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.66,0:20:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh! Huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.52,0:20:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The things I recreate from\Nreceipts are like Shikigami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.28,0:20:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I can give them simple\Ncommands to get what I want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.60,0:20:39.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knives normally don't fly,\Nbut that one should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:43.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given your personality, I\Nthink you're going to say no.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.28,0:20:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you transfer your points to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.16,0:20:48.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise I will give you\Na quick and easy death.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:51.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Barrier techniques are\Ndifficult, aren't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.12,0:20:54.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how long I've tried,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.54,0:20:57.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't been able to\Nget the hang of placing an
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.50,0:21:00.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,artificial space of\Ndifferent size over reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which is why.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.78,0:21:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.56,0:21:10.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to use this gymnasium\Nas is to deploy my domain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.66,0:21:13.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.78,0:21:38.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Domain Expansion Chimera Shadow Garden
Dialogue: 1,0:21:41.82,0:21:44.57,Sign_Basic,Screen,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,310)\fnTimes New Roman\b1\bord0\shad0\fs18\1a&H44&}Domain Expansion: Chimera Shadow Garden
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.66,0:21:47.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know he was a\Nsorcerer on that level
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never said I didn't have big moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.76,0:22:14.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm like a gift that I\Ncan't believe in my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.86,0:22:18.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to find a way.\NI can't believe in my soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.18,0:22:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.00,0:22:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the day is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.00,0:22:26.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What will it be like?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.56,0:22:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the day is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.68,0:22:44.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.86,0:23:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even incomplete, a\Ndomain is still a domain!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.48,0:23:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pulling out my trump\Ncard and activating it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.32,0:23:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not yet, and tour a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.88,0:23:34.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I acknowledge your strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.32,0:23:35.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which of us will get crushed first?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:38.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,GET CRUSHED!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:36.94,0:23:39.90,Next_Ep_Title,Screen,0,0,0,,Next Episode\N{\fs30}Tokyo No. 1 Colony, Part 5

